{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13963","headline":"过三郊驿却寄杨评事时此子郭令公欲有表荐 · 耿湋","name":"过三郊驿却寄杨评事时此子郭令公欲有表荐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冉冉青衫客，悠悠白发人。\n乱山孤驿暮，长路百花新。\n终岁行他县，全家望此身。\n更思君去就，早晚问平津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}